    "text": "The prince had been talking for almost an hour, and the guests were growing tired. Anna looked at the clock, then at the window, then at the clock again. Nobody dared to leave before the host, and the host did not seem to notice the time at all. A servant brought tea, and the conversation turned, as it always did in that house, to the war and to the emperor."
